Z||000019||danny boy||04-12-2001||12:30 AM|||| Since I work for SUNOCO I should be able to shed some light on the gasoline price and supply questions.<BR> We have more than enough crude oil on(in) this planet to last far longer than any of us will. The fuel crisis is not about running out completely, its about supply and demand. OPEC, as of april 1, cut production again.<BR> Contrary to popular belief, we get most of our oil from Canada,not the middle east.Any questions about Canadas supply, this months road and track has a good article.<BR> Prices go up on and down daily. in the last 9 days, the price of gasoline has changed by $.12/gal. $.08 in one night. I do not know what tax is for each state, but the tax on a gallon of gas in WV is.24 state,.20Fed and .05 WV consumer.Thats why gas prices are crazy.Diesel is even worse.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PFF_sig_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
